    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Riing'eeda ea ghoorjooda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Riing'eega fuga Yuda geang'oara galaamooda gharinyeanda; nea aba lagheaneeda hang'waay ea sing'oorsa gurooruunatka nyaawa, ea meadajeega sean bea heeda nyaawa wagiida, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "damanda gudu goopkeadi diibiga nyaawa heeda nyaawa wagiida ea aseeta nyaawa siguura Asherimu mida murdeeda geeta gilinyoo ea nyawiish gil, ea iheenga heayeeniga geawi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea iheenga giijeega mida mooheeda. Meanang'oocheanduumeedeang'wa ea gheaseedeang'wa gaydaadayda ghoah easanga ghwasha riing'eegeagwa aba jeeda moonghajeegeagwa sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajoang'aang'aara geatingeagwa aba heeda hearaniischooda ghayi eagoonyeegwa, ak gaydanung' agadiyeesiina weajoodigeagwa aba ng'eanyiida moanali, aba gideaba nyarasteanyu niyeata beasta nea ea maygamis damanda manda muudeanooda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheega suuk siruku",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya gamus weeta aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giing'ooyda Sabaato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeeshiinean NG'UTAMIIDA: “Una ak gimiinaadi aba gidaghuuta gheeh Benjamini; was dea badiina gah nea gwaritiideawa sugoodiga, ea jeeda gidaghuudajeega sean bea Yerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak giyeeshi: ‘Oaleaydiit ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, Ea sugoodiga Yuda, ea fuga sean bea Yuda, ea fuga sean abiita Yerusalemu, siga gidaghuudajeesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA: Ashageada eaweegeagwa, adiidu goosareeshi eaweeda Sabaato ghana ayeani nea goosiigu gidaghuudajeega Yerusalemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gooruuteawi sareenda jeesinga gealgeagwa eaweeda sabaato, ak ea adiidu googadiiyi, oakghaydiida eaweeda sabaato, gawuurji gida ghayi earukusiindi ghweanigeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hean ghweanigeagwa ea mooleeysiinean iit nea maduupa eara gil, hean ghoahaang'waay iheenga nyaawa ak ea mwayiinya girgweaguutkeasu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘“Inyas gajooleeysean iit ak ea mooyeani sareenda jeedeaba gidaghuudajeesu eaweeda Sabaato, aba ng'ata ghoaghaydiichi eaweeda sabaato nea moogadiyeeni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba gaygwasigu jeeda gidaghuudajeega bea mujiineani sugoodiga jea goopteadawa hoorgeeda Dawdi; ak gabadiina mutukwajeega ea faraasajeega, saawa sea fuga hees, sea fuga sean bea Yuda sea fuga sean abiita Yerusalemu; nea mujiineani gaygoobiita buuneeda damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghapkaana buuneeda mujiinajeega Yuda ea ng'eanyoojiga neaweesa Yerusalemu, ea ng'eanyiida Yerusalemu, ea Shafela, ea ng'eanyiida heayeeniga, ea ng'eanyiida Negebu, nea gweadu haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida ea lukghumajeega, ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi was booga, ea hideeda ng'andit, ak gweadu eara gea badiischooda jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama inyas ea mooleeysiinean iit, ak ea moakghaydiidi eaweeda sabaato, ama inyas ea moanung'waadani sareenda haleanjeeda ak goosikchi gidaghuudajeega Yerusalemu eaweeda sabaato, abeeda gaydang'uda beasta gidaghuudajeagaaschi ak gayghwaak gealga sean bea Yerusalemu nea maygamis.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
